lable to session code; a partial archive is never exposed."},"517":{"id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas-61","page_id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas#attached-archives","content":"Limit"},"518":{"id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas-62","page_id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas#attached-archives","content":"Value"},"519":{"id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas-63","page_id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas#attached-archives","content":"Compressed archive bytes"},"520":{"id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas-64","page_id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas#attached-archives","content":"64 MiB maximum"},"521":{"id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas-65","page_id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas#attached-archives","content":"Expanded archive bytes"},"522":{"id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas-66","page_id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas#attached-archives","content":"128 MiB maximum"},"523":{"id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas-67","page_id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas#attached-archives","content":"Materialized files and safe symlinks"},"524":{"id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas-68","page_id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas#attached-archives","content":"1,000 maximum per archive"},"525":{"id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas-69","page_id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas#attached-archives","content":"Fidelity metadata"},"526":{"id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas-70","page_id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas#attached-archives","content":"8 MiB maximum"},"527":{"id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas-71","page_id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas#attached-archives","content":"Planned entries across attached workspace-file archives"},"528":{"id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas-72","page_id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas#attached-archives","content":"10,000 maximum"},"529":{"id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas-73","page_id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas#subagents","content":"Subagent breadth and depth use managed budgets rather than fixed numeric\r\nentitlements. The service supports high recursive depth and workloads ranging\r\nto hundreds or thousands of live child agents, subject to admission at spawn\r\ntime. Contact support before relying on unusually large fan-out."},"530":{"id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas-74","page_id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas#managed-runtime","content":"Only `/workspace` persists across turns of the same session. Everything else\r\nis reset between turns and removed when the session ends."},"531":{"id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas-75","page_id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas#managed-runtime","content":"Declare OS and language packages with `environment.packages`. Packages\r\ninstalled ad hoc during a turn are best-effort and do not persist to the next\r\nturn. Python environments may enforce PEP 668; prefer declared packages or a\r\nvirtual environment under `/workspace`."},"532":{"id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas-76","page_id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas#managed-runtime","content":"The selected runtime preset's `memoryMb` is the memory ceiling. See the public\r\n`runtime-sizes.ts`\r\ndefinitions and Defaults."},"533":{"id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas-77","page_id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas#managed-runtime","content":"`overrides.maxTurns` controls the agent-loop limit (20 by default, 200\r\nmaximum)."},"534":{"id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas-78","page_id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas#workspace-scope","content":"Workspace storage defaults to 500 GB (decimal). Use `aex.whoami()` to read the\r\neffective concurrency and submission limits attached to the current workspace.\r\nStable admission errors include `workspace_concurrency_exceeded` and\r\n`workspace_submit_rate_exceeded`."},"535":{"id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas-79","page_id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas#workspace-scope","content":"Limit"},"536":{"id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas-80","page_id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas#workspace-scope","content":"Value"},"537":{"id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas-81","page_id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas#workspace-scope","content":"Adjustable?"},"538":{"id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas-82","page_id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas#workspace-scope","content":"Runtime asset archive"},"539":{"id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas-83","page_id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas#workspace-scope","content":"64 MiB compressed, 128 MiB expanded, 1,000 materialized entries"},"540":{"id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas-84","page_id":"/docs/guides/limits-and-quotas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/limits-and-