url":"/docs/reference/sdk#mcpserver","content":"a `submission.mcpServers` entry of `{ name, url }`, and"},"1214":{"id":"/docs/reference/sdk-260","page_id":"/docs/reference/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/sdk#mcpserver","content":"(when `headers` is present) a `secrets.mcpServers` entry of\n`{ name, headers }`."},"1215":{"id":"/docs/reference/sdk-261","page_id":"/docs/reference/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/sdk#mcpserver","content":"For workspace refs (`McpServer.fromId(id)`), the submission entry\nis `{kind:\"workspace\", id}`; the BFF resolves it to inline when\nthe session is created. The user still supplies auth separately via\n`secrets.mcpServers[<workspace-name>]` keyed by the workspace\nMCP's persisted `name`."},"1216":{"id":"/docs/reference/sdk-262","page_id":"/docs/reference/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/sdk#mcpserver","content":"Members:"},"1217":{"id":"/docs/reference/sdk-263","page_id":"/docs/reference/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/sdk#mcpserver","content":"`constructor` (Constructor)"},"1218":{"id":"/docs/reference/sdk-264","page_id":"/docs/reference/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/sdk#mcpserver","content":"`headers` (Property)"},"1219":{"id":"/docs/reference/sdk-265","page_id":"/docs/reference/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/sdk#mcpserver","content":"`id` (Property)"},"1220":{"id":"/docs/reference/sdk-266","page_id":"/docs/reference/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/sdk#mcpserver","content":"`kind` (Property)"},"1221":{"id":"/docs/reference/sdk-267","page_id":"/docs/reference/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/sdk#mcpserver","content":"`name` (Property)"},"1222":{"id":"/docs/reference/sdk-268","page_id":"/docs/reference/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/sdk#mcpserver","content":"`transport` (Property)"},"1223":{"id":"/docs/reference/sdk-269","page_id":"/docs/reference/sdk","tag