ssion finishes.\r\nClean, no workspace dependency. ≙ `File.fromBytes(...)` (a draft)."},"1233":{"id":"/docs/reference/sdk-279","page_id":"/docs/reference/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/sdk#secret","content":"`Secret.ref(handle)` — WORKSPACE: only the handle rides the submission;\r\nthe value is resolved server-side from the workspace secret store. No\r\nvalue ever travels."},"1234":{"id":"/docs/reference/sdk-280","page_id":"/docs/reference/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/sdk#secret","content":"The SDK splits each `Secret` BEFORE the wire payload is built (exactly how\r\n`McpServer` splits `headers` into `secrets.mcpServers`): the env-var name keys\r\n`submission.secretEnv[name] = toSubmissionEntry()`, and for ephemeral values\r\n`secrets.envSecrets[name] = toSecretValue()`."},"1235":{"id":"/docs/reference/sdk-281","page_id":"/docs/reference/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/sdk#secret","content":"Members:"},"1236":{"id":"/docs/reference/sdk-282","page_id":"/docs/reference/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/sdk#secret","content":"`handle` (Property)"},"1237":{"id":"/docs/reference/sdk-283","page_id":"/docs/reference/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/sdk#secret","content":"`kind` (Property)"},"1238":{"id":"/docs/reference/sdk-284","page_id":"/docs/reference/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/sdk#secret","content":"`toJSON` (Method)"},"1239":{"id":"/docs/reference/sdk-285","page_id":"/docs/reference/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/sdk#secret","content":"`toSecretValue` (Method)"},"1240":{"id":"/docs/reference/sdk-286","page_id":"/docs/reference/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/sdk#secret","content":"`toString` (Method)"},"1241":{"id":"/docs/reference/sdk-287","page_id":"/docs/reference/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/sdk#secret","content":"`toSubmissionEntry` (Method)"},"1242":{"id":"/docs/reference/sd